    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>World Champions: Decathlon</strong> \u2013 A Retro Sports Arcade Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jump into the action of the ultimate multi-sport challenge with </strong><i>World Champions: Decathlon</i><strong>!</strong> Test your endurance, speed, and precision across 10 thrilling events in this pixel-perfect, retro sports game that captures the nostalgia of classic arcade sports games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Compete in a Decathlon</strong> like never before! Master events like the 100m sprint, pole vault, long jump, discus, and more in this fast-paced, action-packed arcade experience. Whether you\u2019re playing solo or challenging friends in <strong>local multiplayer</strong>, <i>World Champions: Decathlon</i> offers endless fun and competitive excitement for all types of players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>10 Action-Packed Events</strong>: Experience the thrill of classic decathlon events, including <strong>sprints</strong>, <strong>jumps</strong>, <strong>throws</strong>, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro Pixel Art</strong>: Dive into a colorful, pixelated world inspired by the golden age of <strong>retro arcade games</strong> with smooth animations and charming visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Competitive Sports Gameplay</strong>: Challenge yourself to beat your best scores or go head-to-head with friends in <strong>local multiplayer</strong> mode for a real test of your competitive spirit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple Yet Addictive Mechanics</strong>: Easy to pick up but hard to master! Perfect for both casual players and competitive sports fans alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Olympic-Inspired</strong>: The excitement of <strong>track and field</strong> meets the precision of <strong>endurance sports</strong> in this action-packed title.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Family-Friendly Fun</strong>: Easy to play for all ages, with a friendly learning curve for newcomers to the genre.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Seasonal Competitions &amp; Hall of Fame</strong>: New seasons reset the leaderboard each quarter. Compete for top scores, and if you make it, you\u2019ll earn a spot in the prestigious Hall of Fame!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Replayability</strong>: Always a chance to improve your score! Even after reaching your peak, you can come back in a week or month and set new records.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Why You\u2019ll Love It</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixel Art Sports</strong>: A perfect blend of <strong>retro arcade sports</strong> and modern competitive gameplay that will keep you coming back for more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Action</strong>: Team up or compete in <strong>local co-op</strong> or <strong>competitive multiplayer</strong> and enjoy the ultimate sports experience with family and friends.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Casual Yet Challenging</strong>: Whether you\u2019re looking for a quick gaming session or aiming to master every event, <i>World Champions: Decathlon</i> delivers both casual fun and serious competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Nostalgic Arcade Feel</strong>: Get that classic arcade vibe with fast, accessible gameplay that\u2019s perfect for short bursts of action or longer, more challenging sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready to race, jump, throw, and vault your way to victory in <i>World Champions: Decathlon</i>\u2014the ultimate <strong>retro sports</strong> challenge for <strong>indie game</strong> lovers and fans of <strong>arcade sports games</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613220/extras/b15089eb3df848548f85c5d9d2c00ead.poster.avif?t=1735331391\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613220/extras/b15089eb3df848548f85c5d9d2c00ead.webm?t=1735331391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1613220/extras/b15089eb3df848548f85c5d9d2c00ead.mp4?t=1735331391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Add to Wishlist!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't miss out on the latest updates, discounts, and upcoming events! <strong>Add [World Champions: Decathlon]</strong> to your wishlist to stay up-to-date on available discounts and new content!</p>",
